    "SMALL INTESTINE STOMA" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SMALL INTESTINE STOMA"
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ESTOMA DE INTESTINO DELGADO"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "STOMA DELL’INTESTINO TENUE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soccer was my life, and after my urostomy, I thought it was gone. I was scared to move too much, to get tackled, to leak. But my coach said, “Come back. We’ll figure it out.” I trained slow. I tried different bags. The first match back, I was terrified. Then I scored. My team lifted me in the air, and I cried like a baby. I still have my urostomy, but now I also have my confidence, my team, and my game back." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Soccer was my life, and after my urostomy, I thought it was gone. I was scared to move too much, to get tackled, to leak. But my coach said, “Come back. We’ll figure it out.” I trained slow. I tried different bags. The first match back, I was terrified. Then I scored. My team lifted me in the air, and I cried like a baby. I still have my urostomy, but now I also have my confidence, my team, and my game back."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El fútbol era mi vida, y después de mi urostomía pensé que se había acabado. Tenía miedo de moverme mucho, de que me tumbaran, de que tuviera fugas. Pero mi entrenador dijo: “Vuelve. Lo resolveremos.” Me entrené despacio. Probé diferentes bolsas. En el primer partido, estaba aterrorizado. Luego marqué un gol. Mi equipo me levantó en el aire y lloré como un bebé. Todavía tengo mi urostomía, pero ahora también tengo mi confianza, mi equipo y mi juego de vuelta."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il calcio era la mia vita, e dopo l’urostomia pensavo fosse finita. Avevo paura di muovermi troppo, di essere placcato, di avere perdite. Ma il mio allenatore ha detto: «Torna. Troveremo una soluzione.» Ho ripreso ad allenarmi con calma. Ho provato diverse sacche. Alla prima partita, ero terrorizzato. Poi ho segnato. La squadra mi ha sollevato in aria, e ho pianto come un bambino. Ho ancora l’urostomia, ma ora ho anche la mia fiducia, la mia squadra e il mio gioco di nuovo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
